        <p>VEG ETXRLES (estate worktrieti)...:-One oabbsge (white) : 1, John Kippat ; 2,1 James Kippsx. Six spring onions 1, James Kippax ;2, John I.oppsx ;3, J Rutter. Twelve bulb shallots -1, James Kippax ;2, John Kipp's. Six leeks: 1. John Kippax ; 2. Janne Kippax. One dish pets (12 pods): I, James Kipper; 2, John Kipper. One dish broad beans (6 pods) : 1, James Kipper. One dish Preach beans a 2 pods) : 1, James lappet ; 2, John Kippax ; 3, J Cliffs. One dish of scsrlet beans (12 pods) : I,James Kipple ; 2, John Kippax ; 3,J Cliffe. Two sticks celery (white): 1, John Kippex ; 2, James Kipple ; 3, .1 Rutter. Two sticks celery (red) : I, James Kippax ;2, John Kippax. One v..getage marrow ;white) : 1, J Cliffs. Two cabbage lettuce : 1, John Kippax ; 2, James Kipper.. Two cos lettuce : 1, James K ippsx. Six carrots : I, James Kippax. Six turnips I, James Kippax. Six beetroots : 1, John Kippax ; 2, James Kipper ; 3,J Cliffe. Six parsnips: 1, J Cliffe ; 2, JIVIIIS3 Kipper ; 3, John Kipper. 12 sprays parsley : 1, I Cliffe. Sir tomatoes (red) : 1, P Cliffo. Collection of vegetables (6 varieties) ; 1, Jr,fftro Kippax; 2, James Kippax.</p>
