        <p>CLASSES IN BUTTER-MAKING.—The Cbeehire County Council is prepared to undertake classes for instruction in Butter-making at any centre in the County, where application Is made for such. A class, where established, will be held for a fortnight, but one will not he undertaken except at least eight pupils can be provided at the centre. The Director of Education would like to Lear from any persona who think such a GIBES would be desirable in their neighbourhood, with a view to arrangements for such being made. The drat class will commence in September next.—Applications should be addressed to R. P. WARD, Director of Education, City rd., Cheater.</p>
